  "stageId": "main_06-02",
  "title": "一些誤會",
  "storyCode": "6-2",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_06-02_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "a7e650bdef2c60c4b1fd778d6920e22ace65943a4f9d8fd15da9a2e9679fd917",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "text": "唔，唔......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "不好意思啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "哦，我也不是打了你就不當你是同胞了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "......算了，這話我自己說了都不信。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "煌，通報Blaze-4號小隊，俘獲十數個整合運動成員。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "有機會的話就來接收，沒時間就交給龍門當局了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "那邊的龍門人，把弩放下。沒必要那麼警戒。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "我是哪裡還得不到你們的信任？我甚至救了你們一命。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局成員",
      "text": "退後......！我知道，可、可你......感染者......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "哦，是啊。是啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "嘁。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "博士，走了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "走了！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "哎，算了。Dr.{@nickname}，過來。別動，這樣快點。",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你還好吧。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "喲，看來是習慣讓我拎著你跑路了？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "別用那種眼神看我，說了，我好著呢，這種事發生過不知道多少次了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "我們去十六區的橫山廣場吧。整合運動想要突破防線的話，那裡是必經之道。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "嗯......想要趁勢一舉殲滅整合運動的主要力量，就不能放跑任何一支控制區裡的整合運動。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "按照阿米婭和那個老氣橫秋的陳警官的策略，大部分整合運動會被我們這樣一點點消磨乾淨，最後只要打一場殲滅戰就行了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "先把橫山大廈裡的敵人逼出來，讓他們逃進包圍圈，再去和阿米婭他們會合，一路上順手打打整合運動。簡單明瞭吧？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "......別這種表情啊，我不是說我好得很嗎？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "哎。你要是再這麼盯著我看，我可要直接賴在馬路當中不走了啊。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "抓緊點。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "奇怪......你看那邊？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "那是梅菲斯特的牧群嗎？怎麼這也有，他們不應該是由梅菲斯特親自帶領嗎？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "等等。等等？他們......他們為什麼在打自己人？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "陳",
          "text": "......怎麼回事。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "陳",
          "text": "雖然一直能收到生理訊息，但怎麼一條定時通報都收不到？也沒有緊急訊號的發送跡象。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "陳",
          "text": "究竟出了什麼事......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
          "text": "不好好指揮戰鬥，站在那看什麼呢？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "陳",
          "text": "不關你事，“小姐”。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
          "text": "喂，也太小氣了點吧？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "陳",
          "text": "肯定不能給你看。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
          "text": "我猜你有線人斷線了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "陳",
          "text": "能不能別在這種事情上浪費你的直覺？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
          "text": "至少說中了你就會往下說嘛。感染者？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "陳",
          "text": "是。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
          "text": "......你懷疑他叛逃？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "陳",
          "text": "絕不可能。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
          "text": "那你懷疑的就是這個“絕對不可能”囉。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "陳",
          "text": "如果她真的叛逃了......那種後果，我連想都不敢想。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "陳",
          "text": "當然，如果她會背叛龍門，整個龍門就沒有任何一個人是值得信賴的了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
          "text": "我好像猜到是誰了欸。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
          "text": "等等......她會願意去做這個？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
          "text": "她？幹這個？！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
